<BaseLayout title="About us" description="Learn why Visha Tech Picks exists and how we help Indian technology buyers make informed choices.">
  <div class="content-container simple-page prose"><span class="eyebrow">Our purpose</span><h1>Tech advice for real life.</h1><p class="intro">Visha Tech Picks is an independent editorial project focused on helping Indian students, software developers and professionals make thoughtful technology decisions.</p><h2>Why we're building this</h2><p>Specification lists are easy to find. Understanding the practical impact of those specifications is harder. Our guides explain trade-offs: performance under sustained workloads, upgradeability, comfort, portability and long-term value.</p><h2>What we publish</h2><p>We focus on buying guides, educational explainers and comparisons. Where we haven't personally tested an item, we identify our work as desk research instead of implying first-hand experience.</p><h2>Our relationship with Amazon</h2><p>We plan to participate in the Amazon Associates programme. That does not determine our editorial conclusions. Affiliate links will appear only after account and policy requirements are met, with clear disclosures.</p><p>Our initial focus is English-language content for Indian readers. Visit our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for the complete approach.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
